--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
macOS system frameworks
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ApexClean links only against Apple-provided system frameworks (SwiftUI,
AppKit, Foundation, IOKit, CoreGraphics, QuartzCore, Darwin). It bundles no
third-party binaries, no telemetry SDKs, and no network clients. It has no
dependencies beyond the Swift standard library and the macOS SDK.
